BASSWIESN — Personal Note from the Author
Copyright (c) 2026 Mathias Zimmermann

BASSWIESN was created out of passion for keeping Bose SoundTouch devices alive and usable long after official cloud support became unreliable or disappeared.

This project exists because good hardware deserves a second life.

My goal was never just to build software, but to preserve something many people still use and love every day: simple, reliable radio and music playback at home.

If BASSWIESN helped you bring your SoundTouch devices back to life, enjoy it, improve it, and share your knowledge with others.

Please be respectful when modifying or redistributing this project.
No warranty is provided — use at your own risk.

Thank you to everyone who contributed ideas, testing, bug reports, and patience.

— Mathias Zimmermann

